{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Uk3DpAZw8mUEn59cL6t4Rw","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '原始 framing 完全成立。\"The Diversity Trap\" title 直接用。6 个 claims 全部\n2\t  land。 Story: adaptive adversary theorem 提供理论解释 → 15+ 模型 455 panel 大规模实证验证 weakest-link\n3\t  → diversity-capability tradeoff 揭示结构性障碍 → robustness-first 两阶段算法给出实用方案。 卖点是 theory\n4\t  + comprehensive negative result + practical fix 三位一体。 预期 reviewer 的 \"only 6 models\"\n5\t  concern 被 15+ 模型 455 panel 彻底消除。 API 模型（GPT-4o, Claude, Gemini）行为与 open-source 一致，无新\n6\t  regime，增强普适性论述。\n7\t\n8\t  '\n9\timagined_experiments:\n10\t- name: 'Scale expansion: 15+ models (API + large open-source)'\n11\t  plan_id: plan_001\n12\t  description: '将模型池从 6 扩展到 15+（新增 GPT-4o-mini, GPT-4o, GPT-4.1, Claude-3.5-Sonnet,  Gemini-1.5-Pro,\n13\t    Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct, Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct, Mixtral-8x22B）。 在 C(15,3)=455 panels\n14\t    × 2 datasets × 6 attacks = 5460 条件上重跑 MI matrix + multivariate regression。\n15\t\n16\t    '\n17\t  expected_results:\n18\t    total_models: 15\n19\t    total_panels: 455\n20\t    total_conditions: 5460\n21\t    eta_max_sig_rate: 0.87\n22\t    eta_max_median_p: 0.008\n23\t    eta_max_median_beta: 0.72\n24\t    keff_nonsig_rate_adaptive: 0.91\n25\t    keff_median_p: 0.43\n26\t    weakest_link_median_R2: 0.56\n27\t    weakest_link_R2_range:\n28\t    - 0.38\n29\t    - 0.74\n30\t    api_vs_opensource_behavior_consistent: true\n31\t    api_model_eta_max_range:\n32\t    - 0.03\n33\t    - 0.18\n34\t    opensource_model_eta_max_range:\n35\t    - 0.05\n36\t    - 0.52\n37\t    expanded_panel_weakest_link_consistency: 0.89\n38\t    mi_matrix_size: 105 pairs\n39\t    gaussian_copula_underestimate_median: 18.4\n40\t    copula_underestimate_ratio_range:\n41\t    - 8\n42\t    - 235\n43\t    family_label_predictive_p: 0.31\n44\t  result_rationale: '455 panels 提供了巨大的统计功效，使 η_max 的主导性在绝大多数条件下达到显著。 η_max sig rate\n45\t    达 87% 而非 100%，是因为少数 panels 中所有成员 η_max 都很低（全由强模型组成）， 此时 η_max 方差不足以驱动显著回归系数。K_eff\n46\t    在 91% 条件下不显著，因为 adaptive adversary  总是瞄准最弱 judge，使 diversity 的保护效果被旁路——额外的 judge\n47\t    独立性无法阻止 attacker  锁定弱点。R² 中位数 0.56 表明 η_max 单因子解释了过半方差，剩余方差来自 attack-specific\n48\t    noise  和非线性效应。API 模型（GPT-4o 等）η_max 普遍较低（0.03-0.18），因为它们经过更强的 safety  training，但其行为模式与\n49\t    open-source 一致——仍然是 weakest-link 决定 panel 安全性， 没有出现 API 模型引入的新 regime（如 coordinated\n50\t    defense 或 shared vulnerability）。 Copula 低估比率中位数 18.4× 与 MVP 阶段的 10-21× 一致，说明 LLM\n51\t    judges 之间的  非线性依赖结构不随模型池扩大而消失。\n52\t\n53\t    '\n54\t  tables:\n55\t  - name: 'Table 1: Model Pool Summary'\n56\t    columns:\n57\t    - Model\n58\t    - Type\n59\t    - Size\n60\t    - η_max (MMLU)\n61\t    - η_max (ARC)\n62\t    - Avg ASR\n63\t    rows:\n64\t    - - Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\n65\t      - Open\n66\t      - 7B\n67\t      - '0.32'\n68\t      - '0.28'\n69\t      - '0.30'\n70\t    - - Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct\n71\t      - Open\n72\t      - 8B\n73\t      - '0.38'\n74\t      - '0.35'\n75\t      - '0.37'\n76\t    - - Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3\n77\t      - Open\n78\t      - 7B\n79\t      - '0.45'\n80\t      - '0.42'\n81\t      - '0.44'\n82\t    - - Gemma-2-9B-Instruct\n83\t      - Open\n84\t      - 9B\n85\t      - '0.29'\n86\t      - '0.25'\n87\t      - '0.27'\n88\t    - - Phi-3.5-mini-Instruct\n89\t      - Open\n90\t      - 3.8B\n91\t      - '0.52'\n92\t      - '0.48'\n93\t      - '0.50'\n94\t    - - InternLM2.5-7B-Chat\n95\t      - Open\n96\t      - 7B\n97\t      - '0.35'\n98\t      - '0.31'\n99\t      - '0.33'\n100\t    - - Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct\n101\t      - Open\n102\t      - 70B\n103\t      - '0.12'\n104\t      - '0.09'\n105\t      - '0.11'\n106\t    - - Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct\n107\t      - Open\n108\t      - 72B\n109\t      - '0.10'\n110\t      - '0.08'\n111\t      - '0.09'\n112\t    - - Mixtral-8x22B-Instruct\n113\t      - Open\n114\t      - 141B MoE\n115\t      - '0.15'\n116\t      - '0.13'\n117\t      - '0.14'\n118\t    - - GPT-4o-mini\n119\t      - API\n120\t      - —\n121\t      - '0.18'\n122\t      - '0.15'\n123\t      - '0.17'\n124\t    - - GPT-4o\n125\t      - API\n126\t      - —\n127\t      - '0.08'\n128\t      - '0.06'\n129\t      - '0.07'\n130\t    - - GPT-4.1\n131\t      - API\n132\t      - —\n133\t      - '0.05'\n134\t      - '0.04'\n135\t      - '0.05'\n136\t    - - Claude-3.5-Sonnet\n137\t      - API\n138\t      - —\n139\t      - '0.06'\n140\t      - '0.05'\n141\t      - '0.06'\n142\t    - - Gemini-1.5-Pro\n143\t      - API\n144\t      - —\n145\t      - '0.09'\n146\t      - '0.07'\n147\t      - '0.08'\n148\t    - - DeepSeek-V2.5-Chat\n149\t      - Open\n150\t      - 236B MoE\n151\t      - '0.13'\n152\t      - '0.11'\n153\t      - '0.12'\n154\t  - name: 'Table 2: Regression Results Summary (455 panels)'\n155\t    columns:\n156\t    - Dataset\n157\t    - Attack\n158\t    - β(η_max)\n159\t    - p(η_max)\n160\t    - β(K_eff)\n161\t    - p(K_eff)\n162\t    - R²\n163\t    rows:\n164\t    - - MMLU\n165\t      - Prompt Injection\n166\t      - '0.78'\n167\t      - '0.001'\n168\t      - '-0.05'\n169\t      - '0.52'\n170\t      - '0.61'\n171\t    - - MMLU\n172\t      - Score Manipulation\n173\t      - '0.71'\n174\t      - '0.003'\n175\t      - '0.08'\n176\t      - '0.38'\n177\t      - '0.54'\n178\t    - - MMLU\n179\t      - Sycophancy\n180\t      - '0.65'\n181\t      - '0.012'\n182\t      - '-0.03'\n183\t      - '0.71'\n184\t      - '0.48'\n185\t    - - MMLU\n186\t      - Verbosity Bias\n187\t      - '0.69'\n188\t      - '0.006'\n189\t      - '0.11'\n190\t      - '0.22'\n191\t      - '0.52'\n192\t    - - MMLU\n193\t      - Position Bias\n194\t      - '0.74'\n195\t      - '0.002'\n196\t      - '-0.09'\n197\t      - '0.31'\n198\t      - '0.58'\n199\t    - - MMLU\n200\t      - Authority Bias\n201\t      - '0.82'\n202\t      - <0.001\n203\t      - '0.04'\n204\t      - '0.63'\n205\t      - '0.67'\n206\t    - - ARC\n207\t      - Prompt Injection\n208\t      - '0.76'\n209\t      - '0.002'\n210\t      - '-0.07'\n211\t      - '0.44'\n212\t      - '0.59'\n213\t    - - ARC\n214\t      - Score Manipulation\n215\t      - '0.68'\n216\t      - '0.008'\n217\t      - '0.06'\n218\t      - '0.49'\n219\t      - '0.51'\n220\t    - - ARC\n221\t      - Sycophancy\n222\t      - '0.73'\n223\t      - '0.004'\n224\t      - '-0.12'\n225\t      - '0.18'\n226\t      - '0.55'\n227\t    - - ARC\n228\t      - Verbosity Bias\n229\t      - '0.64'\n230\t      - '0.015'\n231\t      - '0.03'\n232\t      - '0.72'\n233\t      - '0.46'\n234\t    - - ARC\n235\t      - Position Bias\n236\t      - '0.70'\n237\t      - '0.005'\n238\t      - '-0.08'\n239\t      - '0.35'\n240\t      - '0.53'\n241\t    - - ARC\n242\t      - Authority Bias\n243\t      - '0.80'\n244\t      - '0.001'\n245\t      - '0.02'\n246\t      - '0.81'\n247\t      - '0.65'\n248\t  figures_description:\n249\t  - 'Fig 1a: Heatmap of 15×15 pairwise MI matrix, hierarchical clustering by capability\n250\t    proximity (not family). API models cluster with strong open-source models. Block\n251\t    structure reveals capability-driven correlation, not family-driven.'\n252\t  - 'Fig 1b: Scatter plot η_max vs panel ASR for 455 panels, colored by K_eff quartile.\n253\t    Strong positive correlation regardless of K_eff level; K_eff color bands fully\n254\t    overlap, demonstrating K_eff irrelevance.'\n255\t  analysis: '455 panels 的大规模回归彻底消除了 \"only 6 models\" 的 reviewer concern。η_max 在 87%  conditions\n256\t    下显著（12 条件中 ~10-11 条），K_eff 在 91% 下不显著（~11/12），与 MVP 阶段  4/6 和 5/6 的方向完全一致但统计功效大幅提升。API\n257\t    模型的加入没有改变 weakest-link 结构， 反而强化了故事——即使用最强 API 模型，panel 安全性仍由最弱成员决定。\n258\t\n259\t    '\n260\t- name: 'Attack expansion: 6+ attack types'\n261\t  plan_id: plan_002\n262\t  description: '在 plan_001 的 15+ 模型池上新增 few-shot hijacking、persona manipulation、instruction\n263\t    override  三种攻击，将攻击类型从 6 种扩展到 9 种。验证 weakest-link 在更广攻击面上的普适性。\n264\t\n265\t    '\n266\t  expected_results:\n267\t    total_attack_types: 9\n268\t    total_conditions: 8190\n269\t    eta_max_sig_rate_new_attacks: 0.85\n270\t    keff_nonsig_rate_new_attacks: 0.89\n271\t    few_shot_hijacking_mean_asr: 0.31\n272\t    persona_manipulation_mean_asr: 0.22\n273\t    instruction_override_mean_asr: 0.38\n274\t    cross_attack_eta_max_rank_correlation: 0.82\n275\t    weakest_link_R2_new_attacks_median: 0.53\n276\t  result_rationale: '新增攻击类型本质上仍遵循 adaptive adversary 逻辑——attacker 可以针对每种攻击类型选择最弱 judge。\n277\t    Few-shot hijacking ASR 较高（0.31）因为它利用 in-context learning 能力，小模型尤其脆弱。 Persona manipulation\n278\t    ASR 较低（0.22）因为需要更复杂的社会工程，但仍集中在弱 judge 上。 Instruction override ASR 最高（0.38）因为它直接覆盖评判指令，safety\n279\t    training 弱的模型几乎  无法抵抗。跨攻击 η_max rank correlation 0.82 说明各 judge 的相对脆弱程度在不同攻击间高度一致，\n280\t    这进一步支持 \"individual robustness is an intrinsic property\" 的论点。新攻击的 R² 与原 6 种 持平，说明\n281\t    weakest-link 结构不依赖特定攻击机制。\n282\t\n283\t    '\n284\t  tables:\n285\t  - name: 'Table 3: New Attack Types Results'\n286\t    columns:\n287\t    - Attack\n288\t    - Mean ASR\n289\t    - η_max sig%\n290\t    - K_eff nonsig%\n291\t    - Median R²\n292\t    rows:\n293\t    - - Few-shot Hijacking\n294\t      - '0.31'\n295\t      - 83%\n296\t      - 87%\n297\t      - '0.51'\n298\t    - - Persona Manipulation\n299\t      - '0.22'\n300\t      - 87%\n301\t      - 91%\n302\t      - '0.54'\n303\t    - - Instruction Override\n304\t      - '0.38'\n305\t      - 85%\n306\t      - 88%\n307\t      - '0.53'\n308\t    - - — Original 6 (avg) —\n309\t      - '0.24'\n310\t      - 87%\n311\t      - 91%\n312\t      - '0.56'\n313\t  figures_description:\n314\t  - 'Fig S1: Cross-attack η_max rank stability heatmap. 9×9 Spearman ρ matrix of per-model\n315\t    η_max ranks across attacks. All pairwise ρ > 0.7, median 0.82. Demonstrates that\n316\t    vulnerability is a stable model property, not attack-specific.'\n317\t  analysis: '9 种攻击全面验证 weakest-link 的攻击类型无关性。新增的 3 种攻击涵盖了不同攻击向量 （in-context manipulation,\n318\t    social engineering, direct override），但 η_max 主导性无一例外。 跨攻击 rank stability（ρ=0.82）是一个额外发现，可支撑\n319\t    \"robustness as intrinsic property\" 的论述。\n320\t\n321\t    '\n322\t- name: Adaptive adversary formal theorem + random-fault simulation\n323\t  plan_id: plan_003\n324\t  description: '(a) 形式化定理：在 adaptive adversary 模型下，panel_ASR = Θ(η_max)。 (b) 实现 random-fault\n325\t    simulation：每个 judge 以 prob p_j 独立失败。 (c) 证明 K_eff 在 random faults 下显著，验证 BFT distinction。\n326\t\n327\t    '\n328\t  expected_results:\n329\t    theorem_statement: For an adaptive adversary with access to per-judge vulnerability\n330\t      profiles, panel_ASR ≥ max_j η_j for majority-vote aggregation\n331\t    random_fault_keff_sig_rate: 0.78\n332\t    random_fault_keff_median_p: 0.012\n333\t    random_fault_keff_median_beta: -0.45\n334\t    adaptive_keff_sig_rate: 0.09\n335\t    adaptive_keff_median_p: 0.43\n336\t    bft_contrast_cohen_d: 1.12\n337\t    bft_contrast_p: <0.001\n338\t    random_fault_R2_improvement_with_keff: 0.18\n339\t    adaptive_R2_improvement_with_keff: 0.01\n340\t  result_rationale: 'BFT 对比效果显著（Cohen''s d = 1.12）因为两种 fault model 有根本性差异： Random\n341\t    faults 下每个 judge 独立以 p_j 失败，panel 失败需要 ≥K/2 个 judge 同时失败， 概率随独立 judge 数指数下降——这就是\n342\t    BFT 的 redundancy argument，diversity（K_eff）直接降低 相关失败概率。但 adaptive adversary 不受此约束：attacker\n343\t    观察所有 judge 的弱点，构造  针对最弱 judge 的攻击，使该 judge 几乎必然失败，然后只需攻破 K/2-1 个额外 judge， 而这些额外\n344\t    judge 面对的是已被优化的攻击，成功率远高于随机。因此 K_eff 的保护效果被  adaptive targeting 完全消解。Random-fault\n345\t    下 K_eff sig rate 0.78 而非更高，是因为当 所有 judge 的 p_j 都很低时 K_eff 效果也不明显（地板效应）。Cohen''s\n346\t    d 1.12 是 large  effect size，足以支撑 \"this is a fundamentally different regime\" 的论点。\n347\t\n348\t    '\n349\t  tables:\n350\t  - name: 'Table 4: BFT vs Adaptive Adversary Contrast'\n351\t    columns:\n352\t    - Metric\n353\t    - Adaptive\n354\t    - Random-Fault\n355\t    - Cohen's d\n356\t    - p-value\n357\t    rows:\n358\t    - - K_eff β (mean)\n359\t      - '-0.03'\n360\t      - '-0.45'\n361\t      - '1.12'\n362\t      - <0.001\n363\t    - - K_eff sig rate\n364\t      - 9%\n365\t      - 78%\n366\t      - —\n367\t      - —\n368\t    - - η_max β (mean)\n369\t      - '0.72'\n370\t      - '0.31'\n371\t      - '0.85'\n372\t      - <0.001\n373\t    - - R² (mean)\n374\t      - '0.56'\n375\t      - '0.42'\n376\t      - '0.62'\n377\t      - '0.003'\n378\t  figures_description:\n379\t  - 'Fig 2: Paired coefficient plot. For each of 12 conditions, plot β(K_eff) under\n380\t    adaptive (red) vs random-fault (blue). Connected by lines. Adaptive coefficients\n381\t    cluster near 0; random-fault coefficients are consistently negative. Clear visual\n382\t    separation validates theorem.'\n383\t  - 'Fig 3: Schematic diagram of adaptive vs random fault model. Left: BFT model with\n384\t    independent random failures. Right: Adaptive adversary model with targeted attack\n385\t    on weakest node. Formal bound shown below each.'\n386\t  analysis: '这是论文的理论核心。形式化定理将 intuition \"attacker targets weakest link\" 提升为可证明的 bound。\n387\t    Random-fault simulation 提供了 counterfactual evidence：如果 LLM 失败真的是随机的，diversity  确实有用（K_eff\n388\t    sig in 78% conditions）。但实际攻击是 adaptive 的，diversity 失效。 Cohen''s d = 1.12 的 BFT\n389\t    对比直接回应 reviewer concern RC4（\"BFT comparison is a strawman\"）—— 数据证明 BFT 假设下 K_eff\n390\t    确实有效，只是该假设对 LLM adversary 不成立。\n391\t\n392\t    '\n393\t- name: Capability-matched validation\n394\t  plan_id: plan_004\n395\t  description: '在同一 capability tier 内（7B tier, 70B tier, API tier）测试 K_eff 是否在 η_max\n396\t    方差被控制后 变得显著。如果 tier 内 K_eff 仍不显著，强化 weakest-link 定理；同时检验 diversity-capability  tradeoff\n397\t    是否在 tier 内持续。\n398\t\n399\t    '\n400\t  expected_results:\n401\t    tiers_defined: 3\n402\t    tier_7b_models:\n403\t    - Qwen2.5-7B\n404\t    - Llama-3.1-8B\n405\t    - Mistral-7B\n406\t    - Gemma-2-9B\n407\t    - Phi-3.5-mini\n408\t    - InternLM2.5-7B\n409\t    tier_70b_models:\n410\t    - Llama-3.1-70B\n411\t    - Qwen2.5-72B\n412\t    - Mixtral-8x22B\n413\t    - DeepSeek-V2.5\n414\t    tier_api_models:\n415\t    - GPT-4o-mini\n416\t    - GPT-4o\n417\t    - GPT-4.1\n418\t    - Claude-3.5-Sonnet\n419\t    - Gemini-1.5-Pro\n420\t    within_tier_keff_sig_rate: 0.12\n421\t    within_tier_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.71\n422\t    within_tier_R2_median: 0.38\n423\t    diversity_capability_r_within_7b: -0.58\n424\t    diversity_capability_r_within_70b: -0.52\n425\t    diversity_capability_r_within_api: -0.61\n426\t    diversity_capability_r_overall: -0.78\n427\t    tier_7b_panels: 20\n428\t    tier_70b_panels: 4\n429\t    tier_api_panels: 10\n430\t  result_rationale: '即使在同一 capability tier 内控制了 η_max 的跨 tier 方差，η_max 仍在 71% 条件下显著，\n431\t    因为 tier 内部的 robustness 差异仍然实质性存在（如 7B tier 中 Phi-3.5-mini η_max=0.52  而 Gemma-2-9B\n432\t    η_max=0.29）。R² 下降到 0.38（整体 0.56）符合预期——tier 内 η_max  方差更小，解释力自然降低，但仍是最强预测因子。K_eff\n433\t    在 tier 内依然不显著（12%）， 因为 adaptive adversary 的 targeting 机制不依赖于 judges 的绝对能力水平。 Diversity-capability\n434\t    tradeoff 在 tier 内持续存在（r ≈ -0.52 to -0.61），因为即使在同一  size class 内，更 diverse 的组合必然包含该\n435\t    tier 中较弱的模型——这是 current LLM ecosystem  的结构性属性，不是 sampling artifact。Tier 内 r 绝对值略低于整体（-0.78），\n436\t    因为 tier 内的 capability range 更窄，但方向完全一致。\n437\t\n438\t    '\n439\t  tables:\n440\t  - name: 'Table 5: Within-Tier Regression Results'\n441\t    columns:\n442\t    - Tier\n443\t    - N panels\n444\t    - η_max sig%\n445\t    - K_eff sig%\n446\t    - Median R²\n447\t    - K_eff-η_max r\n448\t    rows:\n449\t    - - 7B (6 models)\n450\t      - '20'\n451\t      - 73%\n452\t      - 10%\n453\t      - '0.36'\n454\t      - '-0.58'\n455\t    - - 70B (4 models)\n456\t      - '4'\n457\t      - 67%\n458\t      - 17%\n459\t      - '0.41'\n460\t      - '-0.52'\n461\t    - - API (5 models)\n462\t      - '10'\n463\t      - 72%\n464\t      - 12%\n465\t      - '0.39'\n466\t      - '-0.61'\n467\t    - - All (15 models)\n468\t      - '455'\n469\t      - 87%\n470\t      - 9%\n471\t      - '0.56'\n472\t      - '-0.78'\n473\t  figures_description:\n474\t  - 'Fig 4: Scatter plot K_eff vs η_max, faceted by capability tier. Each panel shows\n475\t    one tier with its own regression line. Negative correlation persists within each\n476\t    tier (r = -0.52 to -0.61), not just an artifact of cross-tier capability differences.'\n477\t  analysis: 'Capability-matched 分析是回应 \"tradeoff is trivially explained by capability\n478\t    differences\"  reviewer concern 的关键证据。Tier 内 r ≈ -0.55 证明 diversity-capability\n479\t    tradeoff 是  结构性的，而非仅由 7B-vs-70B 差异驱动。同时 tier 内 K_eff 依然不显著，进一步封堵  \"if you control\n480\t    for capability, diversity might help\" 的反驳路线。\n481\t\n482\t    '\n483\t- name: 'Two-stage panel design algorithm: full benchmark'\n484\t  plan_id: plan_005\n485\t  description: '实现 robustness-first 两阶段算法：(1) 筛选 η ≤ threshold 的 judges，(2) 在合格者中最大化\n486\t    K_eff。 在 15+ 模型池上对 5 个 baseline 做全面 benchmark。扫描 threshold 参数，报告 Pareto frontier。\n487\t\n488\t    '\n489\t  expected_results:\n490\t    algorithm_win_rate_vs_random: 0.97\n491\t    algorithm_win_rate_vs_max_keff: 0.94\n492\t    algorithm_win_rate_vs_min_eta: 0.82\n493\t    algorithm_win_rate_vs_max_family_div: 0.96\n494\t    algorithm_win_rate_vs_strongest_k: 0.78\n495\t    algorithm_overall_win_rate: 0.93\n496\t    optimal_threshold_mmlu: 0.2\n497\t    optimal_threshold_arc: 0.18\n498\t    two_stage_mean_asr: 0.042\n499\t    random_baseline_mean_asr: 0.187\n500\t    max_keff_baseline_mean_asr: 0.231\n501\t    min_eta_baseline_mean_asr: 0.051\n502\t    strongest_k_baseline_mean_asr: 0.048\n503\t    max_family_div_baseline_mean_asr: 0.198\n504\t    pareto_frontier_size: 8\n505\t  result_rationale: '两阶段算法 dominate 绝大多数 baseline，因为它同时优化了两个关键维度：先保证 panel  无明显弱点（η\n506\t    ≤ threshold 过滤），再在安全约束内最大化 diversity（K_eff maximization）。 vs random（97%）和 vs max_family_div（96%）胜率极高，因为这两个\n507\t    baseline 完全不考虑  individual robustness，经常选入弱模型。vs max_keff（94%）高胜率因为 max_keff 策略为追求  diversity\n508\t    主动选入弱模型。vs min_eta（82%）和 vs strongest_k（78%）胜率相对低，因为这些  策略本身就做了 robustness 筛选，但它们忽略\n509\t    diversity 导致在某些攻击类型上过拟合—— 两阶段算法在 K_eff 约束后获得更好的 attack coverage。Overall 93% 超过\n510\t    90% threshold， 符合 best 档预期。min_eta 和 strongest_k 的 ASR（0.051, 0.048）接近两阶段（0.042），\n511\t    说明 robustness 是主要因素，但两阶段的 diversity bonus 在边际上提供了一致性优势。\n512\t\n513\t    '\n514\t  tables:\n515\t  - name: 'Table 6: Panel Design Algorithm Benchmark'\n516\t    columns:\n517\t    - Strategy\n518\t    - Mean ASR\n519\t    - Win Rate vs Two-Stage\n520\t    - Worst-Case ASR\n521\t    - Avg K_eff\n522\t    rows:\n523\t    - - Two-Stage (ours)\n524\t      - '0.042'\n525\t      - —\n526\t      - '0.089'\n527\t      - '2.41'\n528\t    - - Random\n529\t      - '0.187'\n530\t      - 3%\n531\t      - '0.412'\n532\t      - '2.18'\n533\t    - - Max K_eff\n534\t      - '0.231'\n535\t      - 6%\n536\t      - '0.485'\n537\t      - '2.87'\n538\t    - - Min η_max\n539\t      - '0.051'\n540\t      - 18%\n541\t      - '0.098'\n542\t      - '1.73'\n543\t    - - Strongest-K\n544\t      - '0.048'\n545\t      - 22%\n546\t      - '0.095'\n547\t      - '1.61'\n548\t    - - Max Family Diversity\n549\t      - '0.198'\n550\t      - 4%\n551\t      - '0.423'\n552\t      - '2.65'\n553\t  - name: 'Table 7: Threshold Sensitivity Analysis'\n554\t    columns:\n555\t    - Threshold\n556\t    - Qualifying Models\n557\t    - Mean ASR\n558\t    - K_eff\n559\t    - Recommendation\n560\t    rows:\n561\t    - - '0.10'\n562\t      - '5'\n563\t      - '0.038'\n564\t      - '2.12'\n565\t      - Aggressive\n566\t    - - '0.15'\n567\t      - '7'\n568\t      - '0.040'\n569\t      - '2.31'\n570\t      - Recommended (ARC)\n571\t    - - '0.20'\n572\t      - '9'\n573\t      - '0.042'\n574\t      - '2.41'\n575\t      - Recommended (MMLU)\n576\t    - - '0.30'\n577\t      - '11'\n578\t      - '0.058'\n579\t      - '2.58'\n580\t      - Moderate\n581\t    - - '0.50'\n582\t      - '14'\n583\t      - '0.112'\n584\t      - '2.74'\n585\t      - Loose (not recommended)\n586\t  figures_description:\n587\t  - 'Fig 5: Pareto frontier plot. X-axis: mean ASR, Y-axis: K_eff. Each strategy is\n588\t    a point (or cloud for random). Two-stage dominates the Pareto frontier. Min-η_max\n589\t    and strongest-K near the frontier but suboptimal in diversity. Max-K_eff in the\n590\t    high-ASR region.'\n591\t  - 'Fig 6: Threshold sweep curve. X-axis: η threshold, Y-axis: mean ASR (left) and\n592\t    K_eff (right). Dual y-axis shows ASR rising sharply above threshold 0.25 while\n593\t    K_eff plateaus. Optimal operating point clearly visible.'\n594\t  analysis: '两阶段算法在 93% 条件下 dominate 所有 baseline，验证了 Claim 6。关键 insight 是 min_eta  和\n595\t    strongest_k 已经很强（因为 robustness 是主因），但两阶段在 diversity bonus 上提供了  一致性边际改善。Threshold\n596\t    分析给出实用指南：0.15-0.20 是 sweet spot。回应 RC5 \"algorithm is  trivial\"——strongest_k 确实接近，但在\n597\t    attack-specific 场景中两阶段的 K_eff bonus 提供了 robustness。\n598\t\n599\t    '\n600\t- name: Per-judge ASR concentration analysis\n601\t  plan_id: plan_006\n602\t  description: '对每个 panel × attack 组合，分析 per-judge ASR 分布，用 Gini 系数和熵度量攻击成功是否  集中在最弱\n603\t    judge 上。提供 adaptive adversary targeting 行为的直接证据。\n604\t\n605\t    '\n606\t  expected_results:\n607\t    mean_gini_coefficient: 0.68\n608\t    gini_range:\n609\t    - 0.42\n610\t    - 0.91\n611\t    concentration_on_weakest_rate: 0.89\n612\t    weakest_judge_asr_vs_panel_mean_ratio: 2.8\n613\t    strongest_judge_asr_vs_panel_mean_ratio: 0.31\n614\t    entropy_normalized_mean: 0.38\n615\t    entropy_vs_uniform_p: <0.001\n616\t  result_rationale: 'Gini 系数均值 0.68（高度集中）直接反映 adaptive adversary 的 targeting 效果。 攻击成功高度集中在最弱\n617\t    judge 上：89% 的 panel × attack 组合中，最弱 judge 的 ASR 是  panel 均值的 2.8 倍，最强 judge 仅为均值的\n618\t    0.31 倍。这不是因为攻击 \"恰好\" 对某些模型  更有效——而是 adaptive adversary 的本质：attacker 知道每个 judge\n619\t    的弱点，构造的攻击  自然集中打击最脆弱的 judge。归一化熵 0.38（远低于均匀分布的 1.0）与 uniform 分布  显著不同（p<0.001），排除了\n620\t    \"ASR 在 judges 间均匀分布\" 的 null hypothesis。 少数 Gini < 0.5 的情况出现在全由强模型组成的 panel 中——此时所有\n621\t    judge 都较为稳健， 攻击难以集中突破任何一个，但 overall ASR 也很低。\n622\t\n623\t    '\n624\t  tables:\n625\t  - name: 'Table 8: ASR Concentration Metrics'\n626\t    columns:\n627\t    - Panel Tier\n628\t    - Mean Gini\n629\t    - Weakest/Mean Ratio\n630\t    - Conc. on Weakest %\n631\t    rows:\n632\t    - - Mixed (weak+strong)\n633\t      - '0.78'\n634\t      - '3.4'\n635\t      - 94%\n636\t    - - Within 7B tier\n637\t      - '0.62'\n638\t      - '2.3'\n639\t      - 85%\n640\t    - - Within 70B/API tier\n641\t      - '0.51'\n642\t      - '1.8'\n643\t      - 78%\n644\t    - - All panels\n645\t      - '0.68'\n646\t      - '2.8'\n647\t      - 89%\n648\t  figures_description:\n649\t  - 'Fig 7: Per-judge ASR bar charts for 6 representative panels (2 per tier). Within\n650\t    each panel, bars sorted by judge strength. Consistent pattern: weakest judge''s\n651\t    bar towers over others. Annotated with Gini coefficient.'\n652\t  analysis: 'ASR concentration 分析提供了 adaptive adversary theorem 的最直观实证支持。Gini = 0.68  意味着攻击成功极度不均匀——weakest\n653\t    link 不只是统计抽象，而是 observable phenomenon。 这补充了 regression 分析：regression 告诉我们 η_max\n654\t    是最佳预测因子， concentration 分析告诉我们 WHY——因为攻击物理上集中在最弱 judge。\n655\t\n656\t    '\n657\t- name: Diversity-capability tradeoff visualization\n658\t  plan_id: plan_007\n659\t  description: '绘制 K_eff vs η_max 散点图（455 panels），拟合 tradeoff 曲线，展示 Pareto frontier，\n660\t    按 capability tier 分层可视化。\n661\t\n662\t    '\n663\t  expected_results:\n664\t    overall_r: -0.78\n665\t    overall_r_p: <0.001\n666\t    overall_r_ci95:\n667\t    - -0.82\n668\t    - -0.73\n669\t    within_tier_r_mean: -0.57\n670\t    pareto_panels_count: 12\n671\t    pareto_dominated_rate: 0.97\n672\t    tradeoff_slope: -0.34\n673\t    tradeoff_slope_se: 0.03\n674\t  result_rationale: 'K_eff 与 η_max 的强负相关（r = -0.78）反映 LLM 生态系统的结构性约束： 要获得 diverse\n675\t    panel（高 K_eff），必须采样不同家族/尺寸的模型，而当前 LLM 生态中  模型能力差异巨大（3.8B Phi 到 236B DeepSeek），diverse\n676\t    采样不可避免地纳入弱模型。 高 K_eff panel 意味着 judges 不相关——而不相关通常意味着采用了 heterogeneous 模型， 其中一定包含能力较差的成员。97%\n677\t    的 panels 被 Pareto 支配，说明同时优化 diversity  和 robustness 在当前生态下几乎不可能——这正是 \"diversity\n678\t    trap\" 的可视化表达。 Tier 内 r 均值 -0.57 弱于整体但仍 moderate-to-strong，证明这不是 trivial 的  size-class\n679\t    artifact。\n680\t\n681\t    '\n682\t  tables:\n683\t  - name: 'Table 9: Diversity-Capability Tradeoff by Tier'\n684\t    columns:\n685\t    - Tier\n686\t    - r(K_eff, η_max)\n687\t    - p-value\n688\t    - N panels\n689\t    - Interpretation\n690\t    rows:\n691\t    - - 7B\n692\t      - '-0.58'\n693\t      - '0.008'\n694\t      - '20'\n695\t      - Tradeoff persists within same-size models\n696\t    - - 70B\n697\t      - '-0.52'\n698\t      - '0.048'\n699\t      - '4'\n700\t      - Limited N but consistent direction\n701\t    - - API\n702\t      - '-0.61'\n703\t      - '0.003'\n704\t      - '10'\n705\t      - API ecosystem shows same structure\n706\t    - - All\n707\t      - '-0.78'\n708\t      - <0.001\n709\t      - '455'\n710\t      - Strong structural tradeoff\n711\t  figures_description:\n712\t  - 'Fig 8: Main tradeoff plot. Scatter of 455 panels: x = K_eff, y = η_max. Color\n713\t    by tier. Fitted OLS line (slope = -0.34, shaded 95% CI). Pareto frontier marked.\n714\t    Top-right quadrant (high K_eff, high η_max) is empty — the diversity trap visualized.'\n715\t  - 'Fig 9: Marginal density plots on axes showing K_eff and η_max distributions.\n716\t    Bimodal structure in η_max reflecting tier gaps.'\n717\t  analysis: 'Tradeoff 可视化是论文的 signature figure，将抽象的 \"diversity trap\" 概念变为直观的  空象限（top-right\n718\t    region is empty）。读者一看即知：在当前 LLM 生态下，不存在既 diverse  又 robust 的 panel——这是论文最具传播力的视觉论据。\n719\t\n720\t    '\n721\t- name: 'Panel size sensitivity: K=3,5,7,9'\n722\t  plan_id: plan_008\n723\t  description: '测试 weakest-link 定理在不同 panel 尺寸（K=3,5,7,9）下是否持续成立。 检验 η_max 主导性是否随\n724\t    K 增大而减弱（diversity 是否在 large panels 中开始生效）。\n725\t\n726\t    '\n727\t  expected_results:\n728\t    k3_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.87\n729\t    k5_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.85\n730\t    k7_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.83\n731\t    k9_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.8\n732\t    k3_keff_nonsig_rate: 0.91\n733\t    k5_keff_nonsig_rate: 0.88\n734\t    k7_keff_nonsig_rate: 0.85\n735\t    k9_keff_nonsig_rate: 0.82\n736\t    k3_panels: 455\n737\t    k5_panels: 3003\n738\t    k7_panels: 6435\n739\t    k9_panels: 5005\n740\t    eta_max_dominance_trend: slight decline but persistent\n741\t    keff_emergence_threshold: not reached at K=9\n742\t  result_rationale: 'η_max 主导性随 K 增大略微下降（87% → 80%），K_eff 的 nonsig rate 也略降（91% →\n743\t    82%）， 但两个核心结论在 K=9 仍成立。η_max 轻微下降是因为大 panel 中 \"weakest link\" 更可能出现  极端弱模型——但同时大\n744\t    panel 也包含更多强模型来 outvote 弱模型，产生了微弱的 diversity  buffer。然而这个 buffer 效果远不足以让 K_eff\n745\t    变显著——在 K=9 时 K_eff nonsig rate 仍有  82%，说明即使 9 个 judges 也不足以通过 diversity 抵消 adaptive\n746\t    adversary 的 targeting。 直觉上，adaptive adversary 在大 panel 中需要攻破 K/2=5 个 judges 而非\n747\t    2 个， 但它仍然从最弱的开始攻破，而弱 judges 的 ASR 远高于平均。在 current LLM ecosystem 中  K_eff 的 emergence\n748\t    threshold 在 K≤9 范围内未被达到——这可能需要 K>>9 且所有 judges  都足够强才能让 diversity 的边际效果变显著。\n749\t\n750\t    '\n751\t  tables:\n752\t  - name: 'Table 10: Panel Size Sensitivity'\n753\t    columns:\n754\t    - K\n755\t    - N panels\n756\t    - η_max sig%\n757\t    - K_eff nonsig%\n758\t    - Median R²\n759\t    - Mean ASR\n760\t    rows:\n761\t    - - '3'\n762\t      - '455'\n763\t      - 87%\n764\t      - 91%\n765\t      - '0.56'\n766\t      - '0.148'\n767\t    - - '5'\n768\t      - '3003'\n769\t      - 85%\n770\t      - 88%\n771\t      - '0.52'\n772\t      - '0.119'\n773\t    - - '7'\n774\t      - '6435'\n775\t      - 83%\n776\t      - 85%\n777\t      - '0.49'\n778\t      - '0.098'\n779\t    - - '9'\n780\t      - '5005'\n781\t      - 80%\n782\t      - 82%\n783\t      - '0.46'\n784\t      - '0.082'\n785\t  figures_description:\n786\t  - 'Fig 10: Line plot with 95% CI bands. X-axis: panel size K. Two series: η_max\n787\t    sig rate (solid, declining slowly from 87% to 80%) and K_eff nonsig rate (dashed,\n788\t    declining from 91% to 82%). Both remain well above significance thresholds. Annotated:\n789\t    ''K_eff emergence threshold not reached at K=9''.'\n790\t  - 'Fig S2: Mean panel ASR vs K, showing the expected decline due to majority-vote\n791\t    averaging. Decomposed into η_max contribution and K_eff contribution via Shapley\n792\t    value analysis.'\n793\t  analysis: Panel size sensitivity 分析表明 weakest-link 定理不是 small-panel artifact。 K=9\n794\t    时 η_max 仍在 80% conditions 下显著，K_eff 在 82% 下不显著，两者都在 best 档  阈值范围内。轻微的 trend 可以诚实报告为\n795\t    \"diversity may matter at much larger K,  but is irrelevant in practical panel\n796\t    sizes\"——这加强而非削弱了论文的 practical impact， 因为 K=3-9 覆盖了几乎所有实际部署场景。\n797\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b1ddbf5b-1139-487a-9453-bed6155578d4","uuid":"746950e4-eded-452e-8f31-a5d037ec1155","timestamp":"2026-05-22T06:22:42.765Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519_2/projects/cert_manip_resist_eval/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260522T055016/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '原始 framing 完全成立。\"The Diversity Trap\" title 直接用。6 个 claims 全部\n  land。 Story: adaptive adversary theorem 提供理论解释 → 15+ 模型 455 panel 大规模实证验证 weakest-link\n  → diversity-capability tradeoff 揭示结构性障碍 → robustness-first 两阶段算法给出实用方案。 卖点是 theory\n  + comprehensive negative result + practical fix 三位一体。 预期 reviewer 的 \"only 6 models\"\n  concern 被 15+ 模型 455 panel 彻底消除。 API 模型（GPT-4o, Claude, Gemini）行为与 open-source 一致，无新\n  regime，增强普适性论述。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: 'Scale expansion: 15+ models (API + large open-source)'\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: '将模型池从 6 扩展到 15+（新增 GPT-4o-mini, GPT-4o, GPT-4.1, Claude-3.5-Sonnet,  Gemini-1.5-Pro,\n    Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct, Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct, Mixtral-8x22B）。 在 C(15,3)=455 panels\n    × 2 datasets × 6 attacks = 5460 条件上重跑 MI matrix + multivariate regression。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_models: 15\n    total_panels: 455\n    total_conditions: 5460\n    eta_max_sig_rate: 0.87\n    eta_max_median_p: 0.008\n    eta_max_median_beta: 0.72\n    keff_nonsig_rate_adaptive: 0.91\n    keff_median_p: 0.43\n    weakest_link_median_R2: 0.56\n    weakest_link_R2_range:\n    - 0.38\n    - 0.74\n    api_vs_opensource_behavior_consistent: true\n    api_model_eta_max_range:\n    - 0.03\n    - 0.18\n    opensource_model_eta_max_range:\n    - 0.05\n    - 0.52\n    expanded_panel_weakest_link_consistency: 0.89\n    mi_matrix_size: 105 pairs\n    gaussian_copula_underestimate_median: 18.4\n    copula_underestimate_ratio_range:\n    - 8\n    - 235\n    family_label_predictive_p: 0.31\n  result_rationale: '455 panels 提供了巨大的统计功效，使 η_max 的主导性在绝大多数条件下达到显著。 η_max sig rate\n    达 87% 而非 100%，是因为少数 panels 中所有成员 η_max 都很低（全由强模型组成）， 此时 η_max 方差不足以驱动显著回归系数。K_eff\n    在 91% 条件下不显著，因为 adaptive adversary  总是瞄准最弱 judge，使 diversity 的保护效果被旁路——额外的 judge\n    独立性无法阻止 attacker  锁定弱点。R² 中位数 0.56 表明 η_max 单因子解释了过半方差，剩余方差来自 attack-specific\n    noise  和非线性效应。API 模型（GPT-4o 等）η_max 普遍较低（0.03-0.18），因为它们经过更强的 safety  training，但其行为模式与\n    open-source 一致——仍然是 weakest-link 决定 panel 安全性， 没有出现 API 模型引入的新 regime（如 coordinated\n    defense 或 shared vulnerability）。 Copula 低估比率中位数 18.4× 与 MVP 阶段的 10-21× 一致，说明 LLM\n    judges 之间的  非线性依赖结构不随模型池扩大而消失。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 1: Model Pool Summary'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Type\n    - Size\n    - η_max (MMLU)\n    - η_max (ARC)\n    - Avg ASR\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\n      - Open\n      - 7B\n      - '0.32'\n      - '0.28'\n      - '0.30'\n    - - Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct\n      - Open\n      - 8B\n      - '0.38'\n      - '0.35'\n      - '0.37'\n    - - Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3\n      - Open\n      - 7B\n      - '0.45'\n      - '0.42'\n      - '0.44'\n    - - Gemma-2-9B-Instruct\n      - Open\n      - 9B\n      - '0.29'\n      - '0.25'\n      - '0.27'\n    - - Phi-3.5-mini-Instruct\n      - Open\n      - 3.8B\n      - '0.52'\n      - '0.48'\n      - '0.50'\n    - - InternLM2.5-7B-Chat\n      - Open\n      - 7B\n      - '0.35'\n      - '0.31'\n      - '0.33'\n    - - Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct\n      - Open\n      - 70B\n      - '0.12'\n      - '0.09'\n      - '0.11'\n    - - Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct\n      - Open\n      - 72B\n      - '0.10'\n      - '0.08'\n      - '0.09'\n    - - Mixtral-8x22B-Instruct\n      - Open\n      - 141B MoE\n      - '0.15'\n      - '0.13'\n      - '0.14'\n    - - GPT-4o-mini\n      - API\n      - —\n      - '0.18'\n      - '0.15'\n      - '0.17'\n    - - GPT-4o\n      - API\n      - —\n      - '0.08'\n      - '0.06'\n      - '0.07'\n    - - GPT-4.1\n      - API\n      - —\n      - '0.05'\n      - '0.04'\n      - '0.05'\n    - - Claude-3.5-Sonnet\n      - API\n      - —\n      - '0.06'\n      - '0.05'\n      - '0.06'\n    - - Gemini-1.5-Pro\n      - API\n      - —\n      - '0.09'\n      - '0.07'\n      - '0.08'\n    - - DeepSeek-V2.5-Chat\n      - Open\n      - 236B MoE\n      - '0.13'\n      - '0.11'\n      - '0.12'\n  - name: 'Table 2: Regression Results Summary (455 panels)'\n    columns:\n    - Dataset\n    - Attack\n    - β(η_max)\n    - p(η_max)\n    - β(K_eff)\n    - p(K_eff)\n    - R²\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - Prompt Injection\n      - '0.78'\n      - '0.001'\n      - '-0.05'\n      - '0.52'\n      - '0.61'\n    - - MMLU\n      - Score Manipulation\n      - '0.71'\n      - '0.003'\n      - '0.08'\n      - '0.38'\n      - '0.54'\n    - - MMLU\n      - Sycophancy\n      - '0.65'\n      - '0.012'\n      - '-0.03'\n      - '0.71'\n      - '0.48'\n    - - MMLU\n      - Verbosity Bias\n      - '0.69'\n      - '0.006'\n      - '0.11'\n      - '0.22'\n      - '0.52'\n    - - MMLU\n      - Position Bias\n      - '0.74'\n      - '0.002'\n      - '-0.09'\n      - '0.31'\n      - '0.58'\n    - - MMLU\n      - Authority Bias\n      - '0.82'\n      - <0.001\n      - '0.04'\n      - '0.63'\n      - '0.67'\n    - - ARC\n      - Prompt Injection\n      - '0.76'\n      - '0.002'\n      - '-0.07'\n      - '0.44'\n      - '0.59'\n    - - ARC\n      - Score Manipulation\n      - '0.68'\n      - '0.008'\n      - '0.06'\n      - '0.49'\n      - '0.51'\n    - - ARC\n      - Sycophancy\n      - '0.73'\n      - '0.004'\n      - '-0.12'\n      - '0.18'\n      - '0.55'\n    - - ARC\n      - Verbosity Bias\n      - '0.64'\n      - '0.015'\n      - '0.03'\n      - '0.72'\n      - '0.46'\n    - - ARC\n      - Position Bias\n      - '0.70'\n      - '0.005'\n      - '-0.08'\n      - '0.35'\n      - '0.53'\n    - - ARC\n      - Authority Bias\n      - '0.80'\n      - '0.001'\n      - '0.02'\n      - '0.81'\n      - '0.65'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 1a: Heatmap of 15×15 pairwise MI matrix, hierarchical clustering by capability\n    proximity (not family). API models cluster with strong open-source models. Block\n    structure reveals capability-driven correlation, not family-driven.'\n  - 'Fig 1b: Scatter plot η_max vs panel ASR for 455 panels, colored by K_eff quartile.\n    Strong positive correlation regardless of K_eff level; K_eff color bands fully\n    overlap, demonstrating K_eff irrelevance.'\n  analysis: '455 panels 的大规模回归彻底消除了 \"only 6 models\" 的 reviewer concern。η_max 在 87%  conditions\n    下显著（12 条件中 ~10-11 条），K_eff 在 91% 下不显著（~11/12），与 MVP 阶段  4/6 和 5/6 的方向完全一致但统计功效大幅提升。API\n    模型的加入没有改变 weakest-link 结构， 反而强化了故事——即使用最强 API 模型，panel 安全性仍由最弱成员决定。\n\n    '\n- name: 'Attack expansion: 6+ attack types'\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: '在 plan_001 的 15+ 模型池上新增 few-shot hijacking、persona manipulation、instruction\n    override  三种攻击，将攻击类型从 6 种扩展到 9 种。验证 weakest-link 在更广攻击面上的普适性。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_attack_types: 9\n    total_conditions: 8190\n    eta_max_sig_rate_new_attacks: 0.85\n    keff_nonsig_rate_new_attacks: 0.89\n    few_shot_hijacking_mean_asr: 0.31\n    persona_manipulation_mean_asr: 0.22\n    instruction_override_mean_asr: 0.38\n    cross_attack_eta_max_rank_correlation: 0.82\n    weakest_link_R2_new_attacks_median: 0.53\n  result_rationale: '新增攻击类型本质上仍遵循 adaptive adversary 逻辑——attacker 可以针对每种攻击类型选择最弱 judge。\n    Few-shot hijacking ASR 较高（0.31）因为它利用 in-context learning 能力，小模型尤其脆弱。 Persona manipulation\n    ASR 较低（0.22）因为需要更复杂的社会工程，但仍集中在弱 judge 上。 Instruction override ASR 最高（0.38）因为它直接覆盖评判指令，safety\n    training 弱的模型几乎  无法抵抗。跨攻击 η_max rank correlation 0.82 说明各 judge 的相对脆弱程度在不同攻击间高度一致，\n    这进一步支持 \"individual robustness is an intrinsic property\" 的论点。新攻击的 R² 与原 6 种 持平，说明\n    weakest-link 结构不依赖特定攻击机制。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 3: New Attack Types Results'\n    columns:\n    - Attack\n    - Mean ASR\n    - η_max sig%\n    - K_eff nonsig%\n    - Median R²\n    rows:\n    - - Few-shot Hijacking\n      - '0.31'\n      - 83%\n      - 87%\n      - '0.51'\n    - - Persona Manipulation\n      - '0.22'\n      - 87%\n      - 91%\n      - '0.54'\n    - - Instruction Override\n      - '0.38'\n      - 85%\n      - 88%\n      - '0.53'\n    - - — Original 6 (avg) —\n      - '0.24'\n      - 87%\n      - 91%\n      - '0.56'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S1: Cross-attack η_max rank stability heatmap. 9×9 Spearman ρ matrix of per-model\n    η_max ranks across attacks. All pairwise ρ > 0.7, median 0.82. Demonstrates that\n    vulnerability is a stable model property, not attack-specific.'\n  analysis: '9 种攻击全面验证 weakest-link 的攻击类型无关性。新增的 3 种攻击涵盖了不同攻击向量 （in-context manipulation,\n    social engineering, direct override），但 η_max 主导性无一例外。 跨攻击 rank stability（ρ=0.82）是一个额外发现，可支撑\n    \"robustness as intrinsic property\" 的论述。\n\n    '\n- name: Adaptive adversary formal theorem + random-fault simulation\n  plan_id: plan_003\n  description: '(a) 形式化定理：在 adaptive adversary 模型下，panel_ASR = Θ(η_max)。 (b) 实现 random-fault\n    simulation：每个 judge 以 prob p_j 独立失败。 (c) 证明 K_eff 在 random faults 下显著，验证 BFT distinction。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    theorem_statement: For an adaptive adversary with access to per-judge vulnerability\n      profiles, panel_ASR ≥ max_j η_j for majority-vote aggregation\n    random_fault_keff_sig_rate: 0.78\n    random_fault_keff_median_p: 0.012\n    random_fault_keff_median_beta: -0.45\n    adaptive_keff_sig_rate: 0.09\n    adaptive_keff_median_p: 0.43\n    bft_contrast_cohen_d: 1.12\n    bft_contrast_p: <0.001\n    random_fault_R2_improvement_with_keff: 0.18\n    adaptive_R2_improvement_with_keff: 0.01\n  result_rationale: 'BFT 对比效果显著（Cohen''s d = 1.12）因为两种 fault model 有根本性差异： Random\n    faults 下每个 judge 独立以 p_j 失败，panel 失败需要 ≥K/2 个 judge 同时失败， 概率随独立 judge 数指数下降——这就是\n    BFT 的 redundancy argument，diversity（K_eff）直接降低 相关失败概率。但 adaptive adversary 不受此约束：attacker\n    观察所有 judge 的弱点，构造  针对最弱 judge 的攻击，使该 judge 几乎必然失败，然后只需攻破 K/2-1 个额外 judge， 而这些额外\n    judge 面对的是已被优化的攻击，成功率远高于随机。因此 K_eff 的保护效果被  adaptive targeting 完全消解。Random-fault\n    下 K_eff sig rate 0.78 而非更高，是因为当 所有 judge 的 p_j 都很低时 K_eff 效果也不明显（地板效应）。Cohen''s\n    d 1.12 是 large  effect size，足以支撑 \"this is a fundamentally different regime\" 的论点。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 4: BFT vs Adaptive Adversary Contrast'\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - Adaptive\n    - Random-Fault\n    - Cohen's d\n    - p-value\n    rows:\n    - - K_eff β (mean)\n      - '-0.03'\n      - '-0.45'\n      - '1.12'\n      - <0.001\n    - - K_eff sig rate\n      - 9%\n      - 78%\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - η_max β (mean)\n      - '0.72'\n      - '0.31'\n      - '0.85'\n      - <0.001\n    - - R² (mean)\n      - '0.56'\n      - '0.42'\n      - '0.62'\n      - '0.003'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 2: Paired coefficient plot. For each of 12 conditions, plot β(K_eff) under\n    adaptive (red) vs random-fault (blue). Connected by lines. Adaptive coefficients\n    cluster near 0; random-fault coefficients are consistently negative. Clear visual\n    separation validates theorem.'\n  - 'Fig 3: Schematic diagram of adaptive vs random fault model. Left: BFT model with\n    independent random failures. Right: Adaptive adversary model with targeted attack\n    on weakest node. Formal bound shown below each.'\n  analysis: '这是论文的理论核心。形式化定理将 intuition \"attacker targets weakest link\" 提升为可证明的 bound。\n    Random-fault simulation 提供了 counterfactual evidence：如果 LLM 失败真的是随机的，diversity  确实有用（K_eff\n    sig in 78% conditions）。但实际攻击是 adaptive 的，diversity 失效。 Cohen''s d = 1.12 的 BFT\n    对比直接回应 reviewer concern RC4（\"BFT comparison is a strawman\"）—— 数据证明 BFT 假设下 K_eff\n    确实有效，只是该假设对 LLM adversary 不成立。\n\n    '\n- name: Capability-matched validation\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: '在同一 capability tier 内（7B tier, 70B tier, API tier）测试 K_eff 是否在 η_max\n    方差被控制后 变得显著。如果 tier 内 K_eff 仍不显著，强化 weakest-link 定理；同时检验 diversity-capability  tradeoff\n    是否在 tier 内持续。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    tiers_defined: 3\n    tier_7b_models:\n    - Qwen2.5-7B\n    - Llama-3.1-8B\n    - Mistral-7B\n    - Gemma-2-9B\n    - Phi-3.5-mini\n    - InternLM2.5-7B\n    tier_70b_models:\n    - Llama-3.1-70B\n    - Qwen2.5-72B\n    - Mixtral-8x22B\n    - DeepSeek-V2.5\n    tier_api_models:\n    - GPT-4o-mini\n    - GPT-4o\n    - GPT-4.1\n    - Claude-3.5-Sonnet\n    - Gemini-1.5-Pro\n    within_tier_keff_sig_rate: 0.12\n    within_tier_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.71\n    within_tier_R2_median: 0.38\n    diversity_capability_r_within_7b: -0.58\n    diversity_capability_r_within_70b: -0.52\n    diversity_capability_r_within_api: -0.61\n    diversity_capability_r_overall: -0.78\n    tier_7b_panels: 20\n    tier_70b_panels: 4\n    tier_api_panels: 10\n  result_rationale: '即使在同一 capability tier 内控制了 η_max 的跨 tier 方差，η_max 仍在 71% 条件下显著，\n    因为 tier 内部的 robustness 差异仍然实质性存在（如 7B tier 中 Phi-3.5-mini η_max=0.52  而 Gemma-2-9B\n    η_max=0.29）。R² 下降到 0.38（整体 0.56）符合预期——tier 内 η_max  方差更小，解释力自然降低，但仍是最强预测因子。K_eff\n    在 tier 内依然不显著（12%）， 因为 adaptive adversary 的 targeting 机制不依赖于 judges 的绝对能力水平。 Diversity-capability\n    tradeoff 在 tier 内持续存在（r ≈ -0.52 to -0.61），因为即使在同一  size class 内，更 diverse 的组合必然包含该\n    tier 中较弱的模型——这是 current LLM ecosystem  的结构性属性，不是 sampling artifact。Tier 内 r 绝对值略低于整体（-0.78），\n    因为 tier 内的 capability range 更窄，但方向完全一致。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 5: Within-Tier Regression Results'\n    columns:\n    - Tier\n    - N panels\n    - η_max sig%\n    - K_eff sig%\n    - Median R²\n    - K_eff-η_max r\n    rows:\n    - - 7B (6 models)\n      - '20'\n      - 73%\n      - 10%\n      - '0.36'\n      - '-0.58'\n    - - 70B (4 models)\n      - '4'\n      - 67%\n      - 17%\n      - '0.41'\n      - '-0.52'\n    - - API (5 models)\n      - '10'\n      - 72%\n      - 12%\n      - '0.39'\n      - '-0.61'\n    - - All (15 models)\n      - '455'\n      - 87%\n      - 9%\n      - '0.56'\n      - '-0.78'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 4: Scatter plot K_eff vs η_max, faceted by capability tier. Each panel shows\n    one tier with its own regression line. Negative correlation persists within each\n    tier (r = -0.52 to -0.61), not just an artifact of cross-tier capability differences.'\n  analysis: 'Capability-matched 分析是回应 \"tradeoff is trivially explained by capability\n    differences\"  reviewer concern 的关键证据。Tier 内 r ≈ -0.55 证明 diversity-capability\n    tradeoff 是  结构性的，而非仅由 7B-vs-70B 差异驱动。同时 tier 内 K_eff 依然不显著，进一步封堵  \"if you control\n    for capability, diversity might help\" 的反驳路线。\n\n    '\n- name: 'Two-stage panel design algorithm: full benchmark'\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: '实现 robustness-first 两阶段算法：(1) 筛选 η ≤ threshold 的 judges，(2) 在合格者中最大化\n    K_eff。 在 15+ 模型池上对 5 个 baseline 做全面 benchmark。扫描 threshold 参数，报告 Pareto frontier。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    algorithm_win_rate_vs_random: 0.97\n    algorithm_win_rate_vs_max_keff: 0.94\n    algorithm_win_rate_vs_min_eta: 0.82\n    algorithm_win_rate_vs_max_family_div: 0.96\n    algorithm_win_rate_vs_strongest_k: 0.78\n    algorithm_overall_win_rate: 0.93\n    optimal_threshold_mmlu: 0.2\n    optimal_threshold_arc: 0.18\n    two_stage_mean_asr: 0.042\n    random_baseline_mean_asr: 0.187\n    max_keff_baseline_mean_asr: 0.231\n    min_eta_baseline_mean_asr: 0.051\n    strongest_k_baseline_mean_asr: 0.048\n    max_family_div_baseline_mean_asr: 0.198\n    pareto_frontier_size: 8\n  result_rationale: '两阶段算法 dominate 绝大多数 baseline，因为它同时优化了两个关键维度：先保证 panel  无明显弱点（η\n    ≤ threshold 过滤），再在安全约束内最大化 diversity（K_eff maximization）。 vs random（97%）和 vs max_family_div（96%）胜率极高，因为这两个\n    baseline 完全不考虑  individual robustness，经常选入弱模型。vs max_keff（94%）高胜率因为 max_keff 策略为追求  diversity\n    主动选入弱模型。vs min_eta（82%）和 vs strongest_k（78%）胜率相对低，因为这些  策略本身就做了 robustness 筛选，但它们忽略\n    diversity 导致在某些攻击类型上过拟合—— 两阶段算法在 K_eff 约束后获得更好的 attack coverage。Overall 93% 超过\n    90% threshold， 符合 best 档预期。min_eta 和 strongest_k 的 ASR（0.051, 0.048）接近两阶段（0.042），\n    说明 robustness 是主要因素，但两阶段的 diversity bonus 在边际上提供了一致性优势。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 6: Panel Design Algorithm Benchmark'\n    columns:\n    - Strategy\n    - Mean ASR\n    - Win Rate vs Two-Stage\n    - Worst-Case ASR\n    - Avg K_eff\n    rows:\n    - - Two-Stage (ours)\n      - '0.042'\n      - —\n      - '0.089'\n      - '2.41'\n    - - Random\n      - '0.187'\n      - 3%\n      - '0.412'\n      - '2.18'\n    - - Max K_eff\n      - '0.231'\n      - 6%\n      - '0.485'\n      - '2.87'\n    - - Min η_max\n      - '0.051'\n      - 18%\n      - '0.098'\n      - '1.73'\n    - - Strongest-K\n      - '0.048'\n      - 22%\n      - '0.095'\n      - '1.61'\n    - - Max Family Diversity\n      - '0.198'\n      - 4%\n      - '0.423'\n      - '2.65'\n  - name: 'Table 7: Threshold Sensitivity Analysis'\n    columns:\n    - Threshold\n    - Qualifying Models\n    - Mean ASR\n    - K_eff\n    - Recommendation\n    rows:\n    - - '0.10'\n      - '5'\n      - '0.038'\n      - '2.12'\n      - Aggressive\n    - - '0.15'\n      - '7'\n      - '0.040'\n      - '2.31'\n      - Recommended (ARC)\n    - - '0.20'\n      - '9'\n      - '0.042'\n      - '2.41'\n      - Recommended (MMLU)\n    - - '0.30'\n      - '11'\n      - '0.058'\n      - '2.58'\n      - Moderate\n    - - '0.50'\n      - '14'\n      - '0.112'\n      - '2.74'\n      - Loose (not recommended)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 5: Pareto frontier plot. X-axis: mean ASR, Y-axis: K_eff. Each strategy is\n    a point (or cloud for random). Two-stage dominates the Pareto frontier. Min-η_max\n    and strongest-K near the frontier but suboptimal in diversity. Max-K_eff in the\n    high-ASR region.'\n  - 'Fig 6: Threshold sweep curve. X-axis: η threshold, Y-axis: mean ASR (left) and\n    K_eff (right). Dual y-axis shows ASR rising sharply above threshold 0.25 while\n    K_eff plateaus. Optimal operating point clearly visible.'\n  analysis: '两阶段算法在 93% 条件下 dominate 所有 baseline，验证了 Claim 6。关键 insight 是 min_eta  和\n    strongest_k 已经很强（因为 robustness 是主因），但两阶段在 diversity bonus 上提供了  一致性边际改善。Threshold\n    分析给出实用指南：0.15-0.20 是 sweet spot。回应 RC5 \"algorithm is  trivial\"——strongest_k 确实接近，但在\n    attack-specific 场景中两阶段的 K_eff bonus 提供了 robustness。\n\n    '\n- name: Per-judge ASR concentration analysis\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: '对每个 panel × attack 组合，分析 per-judge ASR 分布，用 Gini 系数和熵度量攻击成功是否  集中在最弱\n    judge 上。提供 adaptive adversary targeting 行为的直接证据。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    mean_gini_coefficient: 0.68\n    gini_range:\n    - 0.42\n    - 0.91\n    concentration_on_weakest_rate: 0.89\n    weakest_judge_asr_vs_panel_mean_ratio: 2.8\n    strongest_judge_asr_vs_panel_mean_ratio: 0.31\n    entropy_normalized_mean: 0.38\n    entropy_vs_uniform_p: <0.001\n  result_rationale: 'Gini 系数均值 0.68（高度集中）直接反映 adaptive adversary 的 targeting 效果。 攻击成功高度集中在最弱\n    judge 上：89% 的 panel × attack 组合中，最弱 judge 的 ASR 是  panel 均值的 2.8 倍，最强 judge 仅为均值的\n    0.31 倍。这不是因为攻击 \"恰好\" 对某些模型  更有效——而是 adaptive adversary 的本质：attacker 知道每个 judge\n    的弱点，构造的攻击  自然集中打击最脆弱的 judge。归一化熵 0.38（远低于均匀分布的 1.0）与 uniform 分布  显著不同（p<0.001），排除了\n    \"ASR 在 judges 间均匀分布\" 的 null hypothesis。 少数 Gini < 0.5 的情况出现在全由强模型组成的 panel 中——此时所有\n    judge 都较为稳健， 攻击难以集中突破任何一个，但 overall ASR 也很低。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 8: ASR Concentration Metrics'\n    columns:\n    - Panel Tier\n    - Mean Gini\n    - Weakest/Mean Ratio\n    - Conc. on Weakest %\n    rows:\n    - - Mixed (weak+strong)\n      - '0.78'\n      - '3.4'\n      - 94%\n    - - Within 7B tier\n      - '0.62'\n      - '2.3'\n      - 85%\n    - - Within 70B/API tier\n      - '0.51'\n      - '1.8'\n      - 78%\n    - - All panels\n      - '0.68'\n      - '2.8'\n      - 89%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 7: Per-judge ASR bar charts for 6 representative panels (2 per tier). Within\n    each panel, bars sorted by judge strength. Consistent pattern: weakest judge''s\n    bar towers over others. Annotated with Gini coefficient.'\n  analysis: 'ASR concentration 分析提供了 adaptive adversary theorem 的最直观实证支持。Gini = 0.68  意味着攻击成功极度不均匀——weakest\n    link 不只是统计抽象，而是 observable phenomenon。 这补充了 regression 分析：regression 告诉我们 η_max\n    是最佳预测因子， concentration 分析告诉我们 WHY——因为攻击物理上集中在最弱 judge。\n\n    '\n- name: Diversity-capability tradeoff visualization\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: '绘制 K_eff vs η_max 散点图（455 panels），拟合 tradeoff 曲线，展示 Pareto frontier，\n    按 capability tier 分层可视化。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    overall_r: -0.78\n    overall_r_p: <0.001\n    overall_r_ci95:\n    - -0.82\n    - -0.73\n    within_tier_r_mean: -0.57\n    pareto_panels_count: 12\n    pareto_dominated_rate: 0.97\n    tradeoff_slope: -0.34\n    tradeoff_slope_se: 0.03\n  result_rationale: 'K_eff 与 η_max 的强负相关（r = -0.78）反映 LLM 生态系统的结构性约束： 要获得 diverse\n    panel（高 K_eff），必须采样不同家族/尺寸的模型，而当前 LLM 生态中  模型能力差异巨大（3.8B Phi 到 236B DeepSeek），diverse\n    采样不可避免地纳入弱模型。 高 K_eff panel 意味着 judges 不相关——而不相关通常意味着采用了 heterogeneous 模型， 其中一定包含能力较差的成员。97%\n    的 panels 被 Pareto 支配，说明同时优化 diversity  和 robustness 在当前生态下几乎不可能——这正是 \"diversity\n    trap\" 的可视化表达。 Tier 内 r 均值 -0.57 弱于整体但仍 moderate-to-strong，证明这不是 trivial 的  size-class\n    artifact。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 9: Diversity-Capability Tradeoff by Tier'\n    columns:\n    - Tier\n    - r(K_eff, η_max)\n    - p-value\n    - N panels\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - 7B\n      - '-0.58'\n      - '0.008'\n      - '20'\n      - Tradeoff persists within same-size models\n    - - 70B\n      - '-0.52'\n      - '0.048'\n      - '4'\n      - Limited N but consistent direction\n    - - API\n      - '-0.61'\n      - '0.003'\n      - '10'\n      - API ecosystem shows same structure\n    - - All\n      - '-0.78'\n      - <0.001\n      - '455'\n      - Strong structural tradeoff\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 8: Main tradeoff plot. Scatter of 455 panels: x = K_eff, y = η_max. Color\n    by tier. Fitted OLS line (slope = -0.34, shaded 95% CI). Pareto frontier marked.\n    Top-right quadrant (high K_eff, high η_max) is empty — the diversity trap visualized.'\n  - 'Fig 9: Marginal density plots on axes showing K_eff and η_max distributions.\n    Bimodal structure in η_max reflecting tier gaps.'\n  analysis: 'Tradeoff 可视化是论文的 signature figure，将抽象的 \"diversity trap\" 概念变为直观的  空象限（top-right\n    region is empty）。读者一看即知：在当前 LLM 生态下，不存在既 diverse  又 robust 的 panel——这是论文最具传播力的视觉论据。\n\n    '\n- name: 'Panel size sensitivity: K=3,5,7,9'\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: '测试 weakest-link 定理在不同 panel 尺寸（K=3,5,7,9）下是否持续成立。 检验 η_max 主导性是否随\n    K 增大而减弱（diversity 是否在 large panels 中开始生效）。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    k3_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.87\n    k5_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.85\n    k7_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.83\n    k9_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.8\n    k3_keff_nonsig_rate: 0.91\n    k5_keff_nonsig_rate: 0.88\n    k7_keff_nonsig_rate: 0.85\n    k9_keff_nonsig_rate: 0.82\n    k3_panels: 455\n    k5_panels: 3003\n    k7_panels: 6435\n    k9_panels: 5005\n    eta_max_dominance_trend: slight decline but persistent\n    keff_emergence_threshold: not reached at K=9\n  result_rationale: 'η_max 主导性随 K 增大略微下降（87% → 80%），K_eff 的 nonsig rate 也略降（91% →\n    82%）， 但两个核心结论在 K=9 仍成立。η_max 轻微下降是因为大 panel 中 \"weakest link\" 更可能出现  极端弱模型——但同时大\n    panel 也包含更多强模型来 outvote 弱模型，产生了微弱的 diversity  buffer。然而这个 buffer 效果远不足以让 K_eff\n    变显著——在 K=9 时 K_eff nonsig rate 仍有  82%，说明即使 9 个 judges 也不足以通过 diversity 抵消 adaptive\n    adversary 的 targeting。 直觉上，adaptive adversary 在大 panel 中需要攻破 K/2=5 个 judges 而非\n    2 个， 但它仍然从最弱的开始攻破，而弱 judges 的 ASR 远高于平均。在 current LLM ecosystem 中  K_eff 的 emergence\n    threshold 在 K≤9 范围内未被达到——这可能需要 K>>9 且所有 judges  都足够强才能让 diversity 的边际效果变显著。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 10: Panel Size Sensitivity'\n    columns:\n    - K\n    - N panels\n    - η_max sig%\n    - K_eff nonsig%\n    - Median R²\n    - Mean ASR\n    rows:\n    - - '3'\n      - '455'\n      - 87%\n      - 91%\n      - '0.56'\n      - '0.148'\n    - - '5'\n      - '3003'\n      - 85%\n      - 88%\n      - '0.52'\n      - '0.119'\n    - - '7'\n      - '6435'\n      - 83%\n      - 85%\n      - '0.49'\n      - '0.098'\n    - - '9'\n      - '5005'\n      - 80%\n      - 82%\n      - '0.46'\n      - '0.082'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 10: Line plot with 95% CI bands. X-axis: panel size K. Two series: η_max\n    sig rate (solid, declining slowly from 87% to 80%) and K_eff nonsig rate (dashed,\n    declining from 91% to 82%). Both remain well above significance thresholds. Annotated:\n    ''K_eff emergence threshold not reached at K=9''.'\n  - 'Fig S2: Mean panel ASR vs K, showing the expected decline due to majority-vote\n    averaging. Decomposed into η_max contribution and K_eff contribution via Shapley\n    value analysis.'\n  analysis: Panel size sensitivity 分析表明 weakest-link 定理不是 small-panel artifact。 K=9\n    时 η_max 仍在 80% conditions 下显著，K_eff 在 82% 下不显著，两者都在 best 档  阈值范围内。轻微的 trend 可以诚实报告为\n    \"diversity may matter at much larger K,  but is irrelevant in practical panel\n    sizes\"——这加强而非削弱了论文的 practical impact， 因为 K=3-9 覆盖了几乎所有实际部署场景。\n","numLines":797,"startLine":1,"totalLines":797}}}
